title Home Assistant: Home, signed in: favourites with their live state (action dots, a chevron on the cover, the sensor grey), the rooms with their count, Settings
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 900
shot home
check home
expect text "Connected"
expect text "FAVOURITES"
expect text "Ceiling light"
expect text "On"
key down
key down
key down
wait 300
expect text "Locked"
key down
wait 300
expect text "Closed"
shot home-garage
check home-garage
key down
wait 300
expect text "ROOMS"
expect text "Bedroom"
shot home-rooms
check home-rooms
key end
wait 300
shot home-end
check home-end
expect text "Settings"
expect text "No room"
expect noquit
